<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11434" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαξ-άπᾱς</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ξᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>all together, the whole,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτρέχων τὴν γῆν ἁπαξάπασαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermipp.
					4.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρα ἁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Stratt.
					36.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπαξάπαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenarch.
					7.16
				</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπαξαπάσης τιμῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mort.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			: mostly in pl., <i>all at once, all together,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				111
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				206
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
